  "priorExpiration": "2018-10-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 405.04 Letters of Recommendation.\n\n(a) The references shall be 3 individuals who:\n\n(1) Are not related to the applicant; and\n\n(2) Are chosen from among the following:\n\na. The applicant’s core mediation training provider;\n\nb. The applicant's internship supervisors;\n\nc. The person(s) furnishing case supervision to the applicant;\n\nd. The applicant's co-mediators;\n\ne. Lawyers who advised one of the parties to a case mediated by the applicant; and\n\nf. Other persons with personal knowledge of the applicant’s professional practice.\n\n(b) The references shall include the following in each letter of recommendation:\n\n(1) An assessment of the applicant's competence as a family mediator, made on the basis of familiarity with the applicant’s mediation work; and\n\n(2) A recommendation as to whether the board should reinstate the applicant's certification as a family mediator.\n\nSource. #9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRES: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12635, eff 10-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fam100-800.html"
